  /// Spawns the Fa CLI with a PTY of fixed size.
  ///
  /// [args] are extra CLI arguments (e.g., `['--model', 'test-model']`).
  /// [extraEnv] overrides env vars (e.g., `{'HOME': tempHome.path}`).
